{"unit_id":"tancheng33__dsh-egress-guard#card-zh","repo":"tancheng33/dsh-egress-guard","commit":"dcb52e1239a70d03ee36db0e39ccbd5979b3da9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-egress-guard 是面向 DSH 的工具调用策略插件，接入 tools 工具执行前后流程。它可按主机名 allowlist 和 denylist 评估工具参数中的网络地址，在 enforce 模式下拒绝不符合规则的调用，也可对工具结果中的常见凭据和自定义正则匹配内容做替换，并将策略判断追加到本地 JSONL 审计日志。默认 monitor 模式只记录判断；适合希望集中配置工具网络目标规则、结果文本替换和调用记录的 DSH 使用者。无需额外账号或 API Key，审计日志默认写入 DSH_HOME 下的 egress-guard.jsonl，规则可在插件配置中调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:161-219","cordis.patch.yml:12-38"]}
{"unit_id":"tancheng33__dsh-egress-guard#card-en","repo":"tancheng33/dsh-egress-guard","commit":"dcb52e1239a70d03ee36db0e39ccbd5979b3da9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-egress-guard is a DSH tool policy plugin. It checks destinations in tool arguments against host rules, can deny unmatched calls in enforce mode, replaces configured patterns in results, and appends decisions to a local JSONL log. It defaults to monitor mode and needs no account or API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:161-219","cordis.patch.yml:12-38"]}
